{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39048","headline":"刺桐花 · 王毂","name":"刺桐花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国清和烟雨辰，刺桐夹道花开新。\n林梢簇簇红霞烂，暑天别觉生精神。\n穠英鬬火欺朱槿，栖鹤惊飞翅忧烬。\n直疑青帝去怱怱，收拾春风浑不尽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王毂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}